{"nadiBisca": [{"id": "nadIBiSca", "headword": "नदीभिश्च", "headword_slp1": "nadIBiSca", "fold": "nadiBisca", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "A numeral (संख्या) may be compounded with the names of 'rivers' and the resulting compound is अव्ययीभाव denoting an aggregate.\n\nTerms: समास-अव्ययीभाव", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["नदीभिश्च २.१.२०", "२.१.२०", "२.१.२० नदीभिश्च"], "synonyms_slp1": ["nadIBiSca २.१.२०", "२.१.२०", "२.१.२० nadIBiSca"]}], "nadyan matup‌": [{"id": "nadyAM matup‌", "headword": "नद्यां मतुप्‌", "headword_slp1": "nadyAM matup‌", "fold": "nadyan matup‌", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The affix मतुप्‌ is added denoting a river.\n\nTerms: मतुप्‌", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["नद्यां मतुप्‌ ४.२.८५", "४.२.८५", "४.२.८५ नद्यां मतुप्‌"], "synonyms_slp1": ["nadyAM matup‌ ४.२.८५", "४.२.८५", "४.२.८५ nadyAM matup‌"]}], "nadyadiByo Qak": [{"id": "nadyAdiByo Qak", "headword": "नद्यादिभ्यो ढक्", "headword_slp1": "nadyAdiByo Qak", "fold": "nadyadiByo Qak", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The affix ढक् comes after the words नदी etc. in the remaining senses i.e. तत्र जातः ४.३.२५ etc.\n\nTerms: ढक्", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["नद्यादिभ्यो ढक् ४.२.९७", "४.२.९७", "४.२.९७ नद्यादिभ्यो ढक्"], "synonyms_slp1": ["nadyAdiByo Qak ४.२.९७", "४.२.९७", "४.२.९७ nadyAdiByo Qak"]}], "nadipOrRamasyagrahayaRiByaH": [{"id": "nadIpOrRamAsyAgrahAyaRIByaH", "headword": "नदीपौर्णमास्याग्रहायणीभ्यः", "headword_slp1": "nadIpOrRamAsyAgrahAyaRIByaH", "fold": "nadipOrRamasyagrahayaRiByaH", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The affix टच् comes optionally after an अव्ययीभाव समास ending in 1. नदी 2. पौर्णमासी and 3. आग्रहायणि।\n\nTerms: टच्", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["नदीपौर्णमास्याग्रहायणीभ्यः ५.४.११०", "५.४.११०", "५.४.११० नदीपौर्णमास्याग्रहायणीभ्यः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["nadIpOrRamAsyAgrahAyaRIByaH ५.४.११०", "५.४.११०", "५.४.११० nadIpOrRamAsyAgrahAyaRIByaH"]}], "nadyftasca": [{"id": "nadyftaSca", "headword": "नद्यृतश्च", "headword_slp1": "nadyftaSca", "fold": "nadyftasca", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The affix कप्‌ is added to a बहुव्रीहि समास the last member of which is a feminine word ending in long ई or ऊ defined as नदी words or which ends in a short ऋ।\n\nTerms: कप्‌", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["नद्यृतश्च ५.४.१५३", "५.४.१५३", "५.४.१५३ नद्यृतश्च"], "synonyms_slp1": ["nadyftaSca ५.४.१५३", "५.४.१५३", "५.४.१५३ nadyftaSca"]}], "nadici": [{"id": "nAdici", "headword": "नादिचि", "headword_slp1": "nAdici", "fold": "nadici", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The substitution of a long vowel homogenous with the first, does not take place when अ or आ is followed by a vowel (other than अ) of the case-affixes of the Nominative and the Accusative.\n\nTerms: संहितायाम्", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["नादिचि ६.१.१०४", "६.१.१०४", "६.१.१०४ नादिचि"], "synonyms_slp1": ["nAdici ६.१.१०४", "६.१.१०४", "६.१.१०४ nAdici"]}], "nadi banDuni": [{"id": "nadI banDuni", "headword": "नदी बन्धुनि", "headword_slp1": "nadI banDuni", "fold": "nadi banDuni", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "In a बहुव्रीहि समास having the word बन्धु as its second member, the first member ending in the feminine affix ई (नदी word) has the ac on its final syllable.\n\nTerms: समास end acute-1st-term", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["नदी बन्धुनि ६.२.१०९", "६.२.१०९", "६.२.१०९ नदी बन्धुनि"], "synonyms_slp1": ["nadI banDuni ६.२.१०९", "६.२.१०९", "६.२.१०९ nadI banDuni"]}], "nadyaH sesasyanyatarasyam": [{"id": "nadyAH SezasyAnyatarasyAm", "headword": "नद्याः शेषस्यान्यतरस्याम्", "headword_slp1": "nadyAH SezasyAnyatarasyAm", "fold": "nadyaH sesasyanyatarasyam", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "In all the remaining feminine words called नदी -- यू स्त्र्याख्यौ नदी १.४.३ and नेयङुवङ्स्थानावस्त्री १.४.४, the substitution of short vowel under the preceding circumstances is optional.\n\nTerms: Some Substitution", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["नद्याः शेषस्यान्यतरस्याम् ६.३.४४", "६.३.४४", "६.३.४४ नद्याः शेषस्यान्यतरस्याम्"], "synonyms_slp1": ["nadyAH SezasyAnyatarasyAm ६.३.४४", "६.३.४४", "६.३.४४ nadyAH SezasyAnyatarasyAm"]}], "nadGasya": [{"id": "nAdGasya", "headword": "नाद्घस्य", "headword_slp1": "nAdGasya", "fold": "nadGasya", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "In the छन्दस् (Vedas) the affixes तर and तम get the augment नुट् after a stem in न्।\n\nTerms: नुट् augment", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["नाद्घस्य ८.२.१७", "८.२.१७", "८.२.१७ नाद्घस्य"], "synonyms_slp1": ["nAdGasya ८.२.१७", "८.२.१७", "८.२.१७ nAdGasya"]}], "nadinyakrose putrasya": [{"id": "nAdinyAkroSe putrasya", "headword": "नादिन्याक्रोशे पुत्रस्य", "headword_slp1": "nAdinyAkroSe putrasya", "fold": "nadinyakrose putrasya", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "There is not reduplication of the letters of पुत्र , when the word आदिनी follows, the sense being that of reviling or cursing.\n\nTerms: सन्धि-हल्", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["नादिन्याक्रोशे पुत्रस्य ८.४.४८", "८.४.४८", "८.४.४८ नादिन्याक्रोशे पुत्रस्य"], "synonyms_slp1": ["nAdinyAkroSe putrasya ८.४.४८", "८.४.४८", "८.४.४८ nAdinyAkroSe putrasya"]}]}